            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">
                🎯
            </div>

            <h3>
                Personalized Insights
            </h3>

            <p>
                Understand what you can improve to make yourself
                more prepared for internship and job applications.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">
                🚀
            </div>

            <h3>
                Career Growth
            </h3>

            <p>
                Build better application materials and take
                smarter steps toward your career goals.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->

<section class="how">

    <h2>
        How CareerAI Works
    </h2>

    <div class="steps">


        <div class="step">

            <div class="step-number">
                1
            </div>

